          "body": "This is what I get with the old code (where old code means the current master with the capture from the linked bug, with the appropriate keys given in that issue configured):\n\n![image](/uploads/a32ab27e094ad684a8de6f7845c4eaab/image.png)\n\nWith the new code from this MR:\n\n![image](/uploads/d3e54ff13b14d173a96cd44965437c16/image.png)\n\nThe September 2017 date is correct, the 1957 date is not.",
          "author": {
            "id": 6764551,
            "username": "johnthacker",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "John Thacker",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/99c30adacedf45514aaf711ba8a44f56322ebb53e9b550b7e3c9cd83bd6a1408?s=80&d=identicon",
