    {
      "id": "c4d8f55e4579e1568c4d3c896d04388ebd17329d",
      "individual_note": true,
      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 2459733175,
          "type": null,
          "body": "OK, so mine didn't have the keys set up to decrypt; how does one convert the\n\n```\nzbee.sec.key == 63:d4:09:ce:21:c7:a7:86:c8:f6:c5:32:2a:34:cb:bb\nzbee.sec.key == fd:6c:c0:70:58:1f:16:11:57:59:70:7d:2f:84:d9:e7\n```\n\nfrom the bug into keys with which to decrypt that capture?",
          "author": {
            "id": 5636682,
            "username": "guyharris",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Guy Harris",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/1b7c243a9b1d6587a9a9067e5d83aba1e87212df7c4eeae3690f791ecbe4675a?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/guyharris"
          },
          "created_at": "2025-04-20T18:12:07.305Z",
          "updated_at": "2025-04-20T18:12:07.305Z",
          "system": false,
