      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 2459737965,
          "type": null,
          "body": "There's a UAT in the Zigbee dissectors, those two hexstrings need to be added as the \"Key\" element of two UAT entries. One is for one layer and the other is for another Zigbee layer.",
