          "id": 2459742486,
          "type": null,
          "body": "OK, the 802.15.4 CRC type appears to be the key (no pun intended) here - mine was set to a different value.\n\nThis all appears to be the universe's way of saying that there need to be several more places where this information can be stored in pcapng files (and, if it's specified by a link-layer type value, pcap files).",
